sequenceDiagram
    %% Investor Complete Journey from Login to Business Outcome

    autonumber
    actor Investor as Investor
    participant Auth as Auth & Onboarding (/onboarding)
    participant Dash as Investor Dashboard (/dashboard/investor)
    participant Match as Matching Queue (/api/investor/matches)
    actor Founder as Entrepreneur
    participant Diligence as Data Room Diligence
    participant Deals as DealsController (/api/deals)
    participant Portfolio as CompanyPortfolioHoldings

    %% Login & Thesis
    Investor->>Auth: Log in & Complete Accredited Investor Attestation
    Auth-->>Dash: Redirect to /dashboard/investor
    Investor->>Dash: Define Investment Thesis (B2B SaaS, €100k-€500k Ticket, Seed)

    %% Discovery & Diligence
    Dash->>Match: Receive Ranked Matches from MatchmakingQueue
    Investor->>Diligence: Select Top Match & Accept Digital NDA
    Diligence-->>Investor: Grant Full Access to Audited Data Room
    Investor->>Founder: Post Diligence Inquiries -> Founder Responds

    %% Deal Execution
    Investor->>Deals: Draft Term Sheet (€250,000 for 5% Preferred Equity)
    Founder->>Deals: Accept Term Sheet
    Investor->>Deals: Sign Agreement Package
    Founder->>Deals: Countersign & Close Deal

    %% Outcome
    Deals->>Portfolio: Insert CompanyPortfolioHolding (Status: 'active', €250k Mark)
    Deals->>Dash: Update Pipeline Kanban: Deal Moved to 'Won / Closed'
    Deals-->>Investor: Business Outcome: Verified Shareholding & Long-Term Capital Equity Asset
